msgid "##### Sparse SFA C8 cache transfer"
msgstr "##### 稀疏 SFA C8 缓存传输"

msgid ""
"For SFA models, `MooncakeLayerwiseConnector` can transfer the contiguous "
"packed C8 main cache directly. Attention writes the quantized NoPE data, "
"BF16 RoPE data and dynamic scales before recording the cache-write event. "
"The connector waits for that event and copies the bytes without applying the"
" legacy K/V INT8 quantization again. Indexer K and its scale tensor are "
"transferred as separate components of the same physical layer."
msgstr ""
"对于 SFA 模型，`MooncakeLayerwiseConnector` 可以直接传输连续的打包 C8 主缓存。Attention "
"在记录缓存写入事件之前，会写入量化后的 NoPE 数据、BF16 RoPE 数据和动态 scale。连接器等待该事件，然后直接复制字节，不再应用旧版的 "
"K/V INT8 量化。Indexer K 及其 scale 张量作为同一物理层的独立组件进行传输。"

msgid ""
"For FP8 main and indexer caches, configure both P and D with `--kv-cache-"
"dtype fp8 --attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype fp8`. Both ends must use "
"matching cache layouts. This path requires main and indexer components to "
"share one KV cache group with the same block-size scale. Noncontiguous "
"packed main caches, TurboQuant, and DCP-replicated indexer layouts with "
"different component block-size scales remain unsupported."
msgstr ""
"对于 FP8 主缓存和 indexer 缓存，需要在 P 端和 D 端都配置 `--kv-cache-dtype fp8 "
"--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype fp8`。两端必须使用匹配的缓存布局。此路径要求主缓存组件和 indexer "
"组件共享同一个 KV cache 组，并具有相同的 block-size scale。非连续的打包主缓存、TurboQuant，以及组件 block-"
"size scale 不同的 DCP 复制 indexer 布局仍不受支持。"

msgid ""
"This transfer path still requires end-to-end validation on Ascend hardware, "
"including configurations that combine it with `AscendStoreConnector` through"
" `MultiConnector`."
msgstr ""
"此传输路径仍需在昇腾硬件上进行端到端验证，包括通过 `MultiConnector` 将其与 `AscendStoreConnector` "
"组合使用的配置。"

msgid "vLLM Ascend supports the following KV cache transfer modes:"
msgstr "vLLM Ascend 支持以下 KV 缓存传输模式："

msgid ""
"- **MooncakeConnector**: D nodes pull KV cache from P nodes.\n"
"- **MooncakeLayerwiseConnector**: P nodes push KV cache to D nodes in a layered manner.  \n"
"- **MooncakeD2RHConnectorV1**: D nodes pull KV cache into local host memory before loading it into device memory."
msgstr ""
"- **MooncakeConnector**：D 节点从 P 节点拉取 KV 缓存。\n"
"- **MooncakeLayerwiseConnector**：P 节点以分层方式将 KV 缓存推送至 D 节点。  \n"
"- **MooncakeD2RHConnectorV1**：D 节点先将 KV 缓存拉取到本地主机内存，再加载到设备内存。"

msgid "#### Mooncake D2RH Connector"
msgstr "#### Mooncake D2RH 连接器"

msgid ""
"D2RH (device-to-remote-host) splits KV cache transfer into two stages:\n"
"**P HBM → D DRAM → D HBM**. Once the first stage completes, P can release the\n"
"transferred KV cache without waiting for D's host-to-device (H2D) copy or decoding."
msgstr ""
"D2RH（device-to-remote-host，设备到远端主机）将 KV 缓存传输拆分为两个阶段：\n"
"**P HBM → D DRAM → D HBM**。第一阶段完成后，P 即可释放已传输的 KV 缓存，\n"
"无需等待 D 的主机到设备（H2D）拷贝或解码。"

msgid ""
"The pull arrows in the diagram represent requests, not the direction of KV "
"data."
msgstr "图中的拉取箭头表示请求，而非 KV 数据的流向。"

msgid ""
"1. **Route the request (1–3):** The proxy selects P, waits for prefill to finish,\n"
"   and forwards the request and KV transfer metadata to D.\n"
"2. **Stage KV cache (4–6):** D's scheduler asks its workers to pull the required\n"
"   KV cache from P HBM into D DRAM. The workers notify P when the first-hop reads\n"
"   complete, allowing P to release the corresponding cache.\n"
"3. **Load and decode (7–10):** The workers notify D's scheduler that staging is\n"
"   ready. D allocates the required device blocks and loads the staged KV cache\n"
"   into HBM. Decoding starts only after the required H2D transfers complete."
msgstr ""
"1. **路由请求（1–3）：** 代理选择 P，等待 prefill 完成，\n"
"   并将请求和 KV 传输元数据转发给 D。\n"
"2. **暂存 KV 缓存（4–6）：** D 的调度器通知其 worker 从 P HBM 拉取所需的\n"
"   KV 缓存到 D DRAM。当第一跳读取完成时，worker 通知 P，\n"
"   使 P 能够释放相应的缓存。\n"
"3. **加载与解码（7–10）：** worker 通知 D 的调度器暂存已就绪。\n"
"   D 分配所需的设备块，并将暂存的 KV 缓存加载到 HBM。\n"
"   仅在所需的 H2D 传输完成后才开始解码。"

msgid ""
"Valid host-cache hits avoid repeated P-to-D transfers. Valid D-local HBM prefix\n"
"hits can also reduce H2D copies; a host-cache hit alone is not an HBM hit. Host\n"
"blocks remain pinned until all H2D reads using them finish."
msgstr ""
"有效的主机缓存命中可避免重复的 P 到 D 传输。有效的 D 本地 HBM 前缀\n"
"命中也可减少 H2D 拷贝；仅主机缓存命中并不等同于 HBM 命中。主机块\n"
"会保持固定，直到所有使用它们的 H2D 读取完成。"

msgid ""
"To enable this mode, set `\"kv_connector\": \"MooncakeD2RHConnectorV1\"` in\n"
"`--kv-transfer-config` on both nodes, with `\"kv_role\": \"kv_producer\"` on P and\n"
"`\"kv_role\": \"kv_consumer\"` on D. Keep the `prefill` and `decode` parallelism\n"
"settings consistent with the deployment and reserve enough host memory on D\n"
"for staging."
msgstr ""
"要启用此模式，请在两个节点上的 `--kv-transfer-config` 中设置\n"
"`\"kv_connector\": \"MooncakeD2RHConnectorV1\"`，在 P 上设置 `\"kv_role\": \"kv_producer\"`，\n"
"在 D 上设置 `\"kv_role\": \"kv_consumer\"`。保持 `prefill` 和 `decode` 的并行度\n"
"设置与部署一致，并在 D 上预留足够的主机内存\n"
"用于暂存。"

msgid ""
"For startup scripts and a proxy example, see\n"
"[D2RH deployment on Atlas 850E](../../tutorials/features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md#d2rh-deployment-on-atlas-850e-uboe)."
msgstr ""
"有关启动脚本和代理示例，请参见\n"
"[Atlas 850E 上的 D2RH 部署](../../tutorials/features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md#d2rh-deployment-on-atlas-850e-uboe)。"
